# 7. Manifest de certificación

Cada certificación debe contener su propio:

```text
manifest.json
```

Ejemplo:

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "certificationId": "aws-saa",
  "name": "AWS Solutions Architect Associate",
  "description": "Programa de estudio",
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "iam",
      "order": 1,
      "name": "IAM",
      "file": "modules/01-iam.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec2",
      "order": 2,
      "name": "EC2",
      "file": "modules/02-ec2.json"
    }
  ],
  "exams": [
    {
      "id": "final",
      "name": "Examen final",
      "file": "exams/final.json"
    }
